<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;"><%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">This is a reminder that your next court report is due on <%= @court_report_due_date %>. Please submit your court report to your supervisor no later than this date.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">You can generate a court report by clicking on "Generate Court Reports" in your volunteer portal. Log in at <a href="https://www.casavolunteertracking.org" style="color:#4f46e5; text-decoration:underline;">casavolunteertracking.org</a> to get started.</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">Please email your supervisor directly if you need further assistance.</p>
